        "body": "Okta is a publicly traded identity security company (NASDAQ: OKTA, CIK 0001660134) that operates two platforms, Okta and Auth0, which the company describes as enabling secure access, authentication, and automation for employees, customers, and non-human identities. The company positions identity as central to business security and growth, offering what it describes as flexible and extensible platforms covering workforce, customer, and machine identity use cases.\n\nOn the AI side, Okta tracks a product called Okta AI, categorized under Security and Identity AI, which encompasses identity threat detection, risk-based authentication, privileged access management, and broader identity AI capabilities. These features are presented as part of the core Okta platform rather than a standalone offering.",
